// __nUlakam/nuNNaRivu/matakkY.qmz — மடக்கை, logarithms__
//
// __Here because relevance scoring needs one and the language has none. The__
// __host offers rounding, floor and ceiling; வர்க்கமூலம் in kaNiqam is built__
// __from arithmetic for the same reason this is.__
//
// __It lives in nuNNaRivu rather than in kaNiqam because the need came from__
// __here. If a second caller outside this folder ever wants it, that is the__
// __moment to move it up, not before.__
//
// __Why a logarithm at all: term weighting needs a function that grows without__
// __bound but ever more slowly, so that a word appearing in two documents out__
// __of a thousand is treated as far rarer than one appearing in two hundred,__
// __while a word in nine hundred is barely distinguished from one in a__
// __thousand. Nothing algebraic has that shape.__

இறக்கு "../kaNiqam.qmz";

// __இரண்டின்_மடக்கை — ln 2, to the precision a Decimal can carry__
//
// __A constant rather than a computation: it is needed on every call to fold__
// __the exponent back in, and deriving it each time would be the slowest part__
// __of the function.__
செயல் இரண்டின்_மடக்கை() {
    திரும்பு 0.693147180559945309417232121458;
}

// __இயற்கை_மடக்கை(மதிப்பு) is a host builtin now.__
//
// __It was an artanh series here: reduce the value to between 1 and 2,__
// __sum thirty terms, fold the exponent back in. Accurate to about 28__
// __digits and slow, and it existed only because the host had none.__
//
// __The host computes it on the Decimal, so the accuracy is kept. It__
// __still returns சரி or தவறு, and zero and below are still a தவறு.__
//
// __What is left below are the two wrappers, which are a division each__
// __and were never the expensive part.__

// __பத்தின்_மடக்கை(மதிப்பு) is a host builtin now.__
//
// __It was ln(x) / ln(10) here, and that division is not exact: log10 of__
// __a thousand came back as 2.9999999999999999999999999998. The host has__
// __a base-10 logarithm of its own, which answers 3.__

// __இரண்டின்_அடிப்படை_மடக்கை(மதிப்பு) — base 2__
செயல் இரண்டின்_அடிப்படை_மடக்கை(மதிப்பு) {
    இயற்கை = இயற்கை_மடக்கை(மதிப்பு);
    (தவறா(இயற்கை)) எனில் { திரும்பு இயற்கை; }
    திரும்பு சரி(மதிப்பு(இயற்கை) / இரண்டின்_மடக்கை());
}
